 2111: //    The eqs. for the 2 lines are: X=X1+(X2-X1)*tt1 and X=X3+(X4-X3)*tt2.	
 2112: //    Output: false: no intersection or colinear; true: exactly 1 intersection.	
 2113: //    If true, (xIntersect,yIntersect) is the intersection.				
 2114: //    Modified to only check tt2, assuming 0<=tt1<=1 is already assured. 
 2115: // **/
